<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.50-0.75 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.50-0.75 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-0.75 lower. Top $54.75. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   54.00-54.75, mostly 54.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   53.50-54.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   52.50-53.75</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   51.50-52.75</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   50.50-51.75</p>
<p>Sows in a clean-up trade for small supply, 300-450 lbs 0.50 to 1.50 lower, 450-500 lbs 2.50 lower, few 500-575 lbs 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs   45.50-46.00, few to 47.00</p>
<p>	    500-575 lbs   48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
